{
  "id": "defaults-in-image",
  "title": {
    "tr": "İmajdaki varsayılanlar",
    "en": "Defaults in the image"
  },
  "difficulty": 1,
  "language": "docker",
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "entry": "Dockerfile",
  "files": [
    {
      "name": "Dockerfile",
      "starter": "starter-Dockerfile.{lang}",
      "solution": "solution-Dockerfile"
    },
    {
      "name": "app.py",
      "readonly": true
    }
  ],
  "timeout_sec": 180,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "`ENV APP_ENV=production` ve `ENV PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1`.",
      "en": "`ENV APP_ENV=production` and `ENV PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n**Dockerfile**\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM python:3.13-slim\nWORKDIR /app\nENV APP_ENV=production\nENV PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1\nCOPY app.py .\nCMD [\"python\", \"app.py\"]\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n**Dockerfile**\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM python:3.13-slim\nWORKDIR /app\nENV APP_ENV=production\nENV PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1\nCOPY app.py .\nCMD [\"python\", \"app.py\"]\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "container",
      "expect": {
        "env": {
          "APP_ENV": "production",
          "PYTHONUNBUFFERED": "1"
        },
        "logs": "env: production"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "run": {
        "env": {
          "APP_ENV": "test"
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "logs": "env: test"
      }
    }
  ]
}
